asic\"><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"> Charisma +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"> Charisma +6</a></b>: This item makes the wearer have more flair, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Charisma.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Command_(enchantment)\" title=\"Command (enchantment)\">Insightful Command +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Command_(enchantment)\" title=\"Command (enchantment)\">Insightful Command</a>:</b> Passive: +4 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> on <a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> based <a href=\"/page/Skill_check\" title=\"Skill check\">skill checks</a>. Command armor and command shields make their owners very noticeable, imposing a -6 penalty on <a href=\"/page/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">Hide</a> checks.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1